PORTFOLIO FORMULA?
What is the portfolio formula?

PORTFOLIO = SHARES * CURRENT_MARKET_PRICE

SHOULD CHANGE AS THE MARKET PRICE CHANGES

ACTUAL FORMULA USED:
NET_SHARES = Σ(shares_bought - shares_sold) per (market, outcome)

PORTFOLIO_VALUE = Net_Shares × 100 × Probability_of_Winning
Where:
  Probability_of_Winning = P_yes if outcome='Yes', else (1 - P_yes)
  P_yes = exp(q_yes/b) / (exp(q_yes/b) + exp(q_no/b))  [YES Probability]
  100 = KES payout per share when outcome wins

