PAYOUT FORMULA?
What is the payout formula?

PAYOUT = (SHARES * FINAL_MARKET_PRICE) 

NET_PAYOUT = PAYOUT - TRADING_FEE

PROFIT/LOSS = (SHARES * FINAL_PRICE ) - (SHARES * INITIAL_PRICE)


CASH_AFTER_PAYOUT = CASH_BEFORE_PAYOUT + NET_PAYOUT

PORTFOLIO_AFTER_PAYOUT = PORTFOLIO_BEFORE_PAYOUT - PAYOUT

ACTUAL FORMULA USED:
WHEN MARKET RESOLVES:
PAYOUT = SHARES × 100  [if outcome matches bet]
      = 0               [if outcome doesn't match]

WHEN USER SELLS (before resolution):
PAYOUT = (C_before - C_after) × 100  [LMSR sell payout]

PROFIT/LOSS = CURRENT_VALUE - TOTAL_COST_TO_BUY
Where:
  CURRENT_VALUE = (shares_bought - shares_sold) × 100 × probability
  TOTAL_COST_TO_BUY = Σ(cost to buy each lot)

CASH_AFTER_PAYOUT = CASH_BEFORE + PAYOUT

PORTFOLIO_AFTER_PAYOUT = PORTFOLIO_BEFORE - NET_SHARES × 100 × PROBABILITY

FOR WINNERS: Balance += PAYOUT
FOR LOSERS: User loses the KES spent (payout = 0)

